&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base (fixed) salary for this role ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$182,250 to $218,500 USD&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(min to max of base salary pay range). This salary range applies to our offices in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location and region of the role in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of Employee Stock Options (ESOPs). To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we believe that our employees should have the ability to own a part of the organization. Furthermore, as you contribute to the growth of the company, additional stock may be issued in recognition of your contribution over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and a compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Head of Sales&lt;/strong&gt;, within InMobi Advertising Platform, you will be a key member of the InMobi META (Middle East, Turkey &amp;amp; Africa) team based in Dubai, UAE, responsible for driving existing and new business for &lt;strong&gt;Key Verticals such as FMCG, F&amp;amp;B, Gaming, Travel &amp;amp; Tourism and Digital Native&lt;/strong&gt; with both direct brands and agencies within industries. You will work closely with a variety of internal stakeholders (Sales, Product, Business Development, Technical Operations, Business Analysts, &amp;amp; Creative Services) to ensure aggressive revenue growth across InMobi Ad products. The role requires the individual to always positioning InMobi as a leading player in the mobile advertising industry through thought leadership, education and representation in all areas.&amp;nbsp;You will also be showcasing high intent and drive&amp;nbsp;towards promoting our solutions through excellent research, analytical, presentation and communication (written and verbal) skills and the ability to create compelling, persuasive presentations for clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the vision and manage existing agency and direct clients in META (- KSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve/ over-achieve revenue targets across InMobi Platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi-stakeholder relationships with new &amp;amp; existing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with revenue delivery and account management teams to respond to RFP’s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams to generate insights and analytics for advertisers within your verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively drive the implementation of concepts and client briefs with internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the cross-functional support required to ensure that ad campaigns match client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creation and management of a pipeline of sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work towards meeting monthly, quarterly and annual revenue and monetization targets. Maintain regular, accurate forecasts and a healthy pipeline of opportunities.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What we require from you:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident persona, comfortable talking to potential clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are goal oriented and have a knack for attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and problem-solving tools with a &#39;can do&#39; attitude and the ability to partner collaboratively with other functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal candidates must possess&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional personable skills which enable strong relationships with clients, underpinned by trust, accountability and an undisputed client first mentality, obsessed with driving the best for your business unit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent research, analytical, presentation and communication (written and verbal) skills and the ability to create compelling, persuasive presentations for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Should have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to work across different global cultures and in a matrix style environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Microsoft Excel/PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices. InMobi Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;family like?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities. InMobians are passionate and driven, creative and fun-loving, take ownership and are results-focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission-critical for InMobi and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training, and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?  &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Microsoft and InMobi have entered into partnership, as per which, InMobi will be the preferred partner for Microsoft’s Search and Audience Inventory (Native Display and Video). Microsoft Advertising empowers the largest advertisers around the world to reach their maximum potential through Search, Native, Video and Display advertising on Microsoft platforms and inventory. InMobi will be responsible for sales and development followed by end to end management of these client activities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a top performing Assistant Sales Manager with online advertising/Sales experience who can drive revenue and increase customer satisfaction by developing and cultivating strategic client relationships and delivering customized branding solutions by aligning to the client’s advertising needs. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Assistant Sales Manager for display advertising enables Microsoft to better serve strategic customers by applying customer obsession to what clients care about and need, ensuring our Microsoft story is valued and understood, and acting to build successful, long-term relationships. The Assistant Sales Manager drives both revenue and customer satisfaction. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Assistant Sales Manager drives new account acquisition and grows incremental revenue against a targeted list of high potential agencies through engagement. In conjunction with the Central teams and Account Managers, Assistant Sales Manager develops quality customer plans laying out revenue and customer satisfaction growth strategies. Success is measured by specific key performance indicators focused on driving product adoption, emphasizing customer experience and optimizing opportunities. In addition, the Assistant Sales Manager builds and maintains a pipeline of clients and agencies new to the Microsoft Audience Network proposition. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is expected out of you?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy predictable pipeline to deliver quota expectations: Consistently create high value revenue-generating opportunities. Lead regular, impactful engagements with key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Microsoft Advertising&#39;s share of wallet across client portfolio by highlighting missed opportunities around Branding activities. Create a convincing storyline and pitch which will help client side decision makers to meet or exceed their marketing goals.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage current relationships in the advertising ecosystem to drive adoption conversations as well as open up new relationships in the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge relationships with client-side marketing heads and build industry presence for yourself and the products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent advocate of the Microsoft Story: Educate clients on how Microsoft Ad features and offerings help them to reach their business goals and new markets/targets. Utilize all available readiness materials (inclusive of Marketing materials, Training &amp;amp; other GTM assets) and insights to ensure you are a fluent advocate of the Microsoft Advertising story.  Develop and demonstrate an intermediate to expert level knowledge of emerging products/features.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer and partner Planning:  Develop and maintain high quality, actionable Customer Plans (where applicable) and Joint Business Plans (where applicable).  Demonstrate a deep understanding of customer needs, challenges/concerns and goals/objectives. Develop a cohesive action plan to address those opportunities. Agreed plan with customer. Review quarterly with management. Lead execution of all agreed Account Plan/JBP action items. Ensures follow-through by all participants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and high-performing account team: Coordinate with Account Manager Head to ensure timely and proactive customer escalations by effectively leveraging internal partner network to resolve Account escalations &amp;amp; revenue blockers. Capture feedback and influence solutions internally. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous business learning and professional growth: Continually strengthen your Microsoft Ads and Branding expertise, take personal accountability for your career and personal development; create, update and regularly check in on your career development plan. Complete required and recommended trainings and apply what you learn to further your growth in role and career progression&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is expected out of you?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4-5 years’ online media sales/ advertising experience required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; Advanced degree preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceptional performance, high productivity, communications skills and meeting deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to consistently meet or exceed revenue goals or targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to understand customer needs, create and deliver customized, customer-focused pitches and solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively navigate through ambiguity and complexities related to client management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talented in storytelling and delivering engaging presentations across all levels of leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate customer sales negotiations and technical presentations in person and remotely&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of the branding industry, native display products, customer&#39;s needs, Microsoft’s strategy and how they work together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology as an enabler for company growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Mumbai , should be willing to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Branding Digital Ad Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Native Display Ad Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bing Ads Certification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to creating disruptive and innovative consumer experiences using technology. We value autonomy, collaboration, technical innovation, and results-oriented thinking.&amp;nbsp;InMobi’s&amp;nbsp;culture is all about rewarding excellence so there are fantastic opportunities for the right candidates!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is building a global brand for a category most people can&#39;t picture: the invisible infrastructure that connects billions of users to the content, commerce, and advertising they see every day. Making that visible, and making it feel like something worth paying attention to, is the job of this team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a brand designer with at least six years of experience across identity and visual systems work and day-to-day marketing production. You are able to do both: identity work in partnership with the Creative Director, and high-volume production of campaign materials and activations across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work from rough briefs, hold a clear point of view on typography, color, and composition, and can explain your decisions to marketers, sellers, and executives. You manage your own projects and flag timeline risk early. This role suits someone who wants that level of ownership early in their career, and who wants their work visible to the market rather than buried in a template.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;: &lt;em&gt;This role is based onsite in our NYC office. Some travel may be required to support events and activations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design campaigns, events and trade show environments, keynote and sales decks, OOH, web, social, and print, from concept through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and maintain the brand system so it holds across regions, products, and audiences, and gives the wider team something to move fast with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry high-volume, quick-turnaround work without letting craft slip&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce with a high level of detail across every format, from static layouts to motion. Kerning, spacing, easing, and timing all get the same scrutiny.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product marketing, events, content, motion, sales, and outside production. Scoping, timelines, and shipping are yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design with a point of view, and treat feedback as a constructive element that makes the next iteration better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the templates and asset library so nobody rebuilds the same file twice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools as part of your standard workflow for exploration, iteration, and production, and apply them where they measurably improve speed or output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in brand or marketing design, ideally across in-house and agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio with both identity work and campaign work, and clarity on what was yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep command of typography, hierarchy, composition, and layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsessive attention to detail across static and motion work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, and PowerPoint (presentation design is a real part of this role)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building brand systems that work across digital and physical formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable holding several workstreams at once and making your own calls on priority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production-ready file prep for digital, print, and large format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable integrating AI tools into a modern design workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion or animation (After Effects, Figma prototyping, 3D)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiential or event design background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer, retail, beauty, or lifestyle brand experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adtech or SaaS experience, turning complex schematics into captivating creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asana, Frontify, Ceros, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why InMobi?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a global team shaping the future of the open internet&#39;s advertising ecosystem — with visible impact, a supportive and ambitious peer group, and continuous investment in your growth. InMobi offers competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and a culture built on ownership, curiosity, and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The base salary (fixed salary) for this role ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$95,250 to $108,500 USD&lt;/strong&gt; (minimum to maximum base salary). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location or region of the role in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of Employee Stock Options (ESOPs). We believe that our employees/personnel should have the ability to own a part of the entity they are a part of. Therefore, the entity employing you may elect to provide such stock to you. Stock ownership enables us to treat our employer company as our own and base our decisions on the company’s best interests. To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we grant InMobians relevant company stock(s). As you contribute to the growth of your company, certain stocks may be issued to you in recognition of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our U.S. benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch is provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
